  "title": "Trump's Military Drills Reduction and North Korea's Strategy",
  "summary": "President Trump orders Pentagon to scale back U.S.-South Korea military drills, citing a'very good relationship' with North Korea. This move, part of a series of drills called the Ulchi Freedom Shield, is seen as a counter to North Korea's evolving battlefield tactics.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "President Trump ordered the Pentagon to scale back military drills with South Korea to address North Korea's evolving battlefield tactics.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The drills, part of a series known as the Ulchi Freedom Shield, continue until August.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The decision to scale back exercises was made to avoid potential threats posed by North Korea's war strategy.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
